sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant R as MessageRouter
  participant VH as VerificationHandler
  participant V as Verifier
  participant P as Perceptron Mk1.5
  participant C as EvidenceClassifier
  participant L as Ledger
  participant O as OverlayRenderer
  participant GS as GuidanceService
  U->>R: after photo
  R->>VH: handle(photo, session in guiding)
  VH->>V: verify(photo, plannedItems)
  V->>P: is each label visible? boxes (JSON schema)
  P-->>V: label, visible, box for each
  V-->>VH: AfterResult[]
  loop each item
    VH->>C: classify(item, beforeBox, result, zones)
    C-->>VH: verified / not_visible / still_here / wrong_spot
    VH->>L: append(item, state, photo)
  end
  VH->>GS: reopen steps for still_here and wrong_spot
  VH->>O: renderVerdict(photo, items)
  O-->>VH: verdict.png
  VH-->>R: overlay + summary
  R-->>U: "3 verified, 2 off the desk (can't confirm), 1 still here"
